<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="eyebrow">
      <view class="rule"></view>
      <text>Evidence before confidence</text>
      <view class="rule"></view>
    </view>
    <view class="hero-title">
      <text>让每一条参考文献</text>
      <text>都经得起核验</text>
    </view>
    <view class="hero-copy">
      可粘贴或导入多条中英文参考文献，单次自动核验前 20 条。先判断文献是否真实存在，再核对字段。中文按 GB/T 7714—2025，英文容忍不同引用格式。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card workspace">
    <view class="workspace-head">
      <view>
        <view class="section-title">提交参考文献</view>
        <view class="section-copy">支持不规范著录和多条连续粘贴</view>
      </view>
      <button class="button-quiet sample-button" size="mini" bindtap="fillSample" disabled="{{loading}}">填入示例</button>
    </view>

    <textarea
      class="reference-input"
      value="{{inputValue}}"
      maxlength="-1"
      placeholder="{{inputPlaceholder}}"
      placeholder-class="input-placeholder"
      bindinput="onInput"
      disabled="{{loading}}"
    ></textarea>

    <view class="input-actions">
      <view class="counter {{count > maxReferences ? 'counter-over' : ''}}">
        <text class="counter-label">已识别</text>
        <text class="counter-value">{{count > maxReferences ? maxReferences : count}}</text>
        <text class="counter-limit">/ {{maxReferences}} 条</text>
        <text wx:if="{{count > maxReferences}}" class="counter-label">（共 {{count}} 条）</text>
      </view>
      <view class="action-buttons">
        <button class="button-secondary clear-button" bindtap="clearInput" disabled="{{(!inputValue && !fileReading) || loading}}">清空</button>
        <button class="button-primary verify-button" bindtap="verifyAll" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{!loading && !canVerify}}">
          {{loading ? "停止核验" : "开始核验"}}
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="divider">
      <view></view>
      <text>或者导入文档</text>
      <view></view>
    </view>

    <view class="upload" bindtap="chooseDocument">
      <view class="upload-icon">↑</view>
      <view class="upload-copy">
        <view class="upload-title">从微信聊天中选择文件</view>
        <view class="upload-description">TXT · DOCX · 文字版 PDF，最大 10 MB</view>
      </view>
      <view class="upload-arrow">›</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{fileMessage}}" class="file-message file-{{fileMessageType}}">{{fileMessage}}</view>
    <view class="privacy-note">文档仅用于提取参考文献，云端处理后立即删除。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="trust-row">
    <view><text>✓</text> 未收录不直接判为虚假</view>
    <view><text>✓</text> 中文期刊与网络文献增强核验</view>
  </view>

  <view class="account-strip">
    <view class="account-copy">
      <view class="account-title">{{historyEnabled ? "历史记录已启用" : "无需登录也能核验"}}</view>
      <view class="account-note">
        {{historyEnabled ? "已保存 " + historyCount + " 次核验，可在当前微信账号下查看" : "启用微信身份后，可保存和查看核验历史"}}
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="account-actions" wx:if="{{historyEnabled}}">
      <button class="account-button" size="mini" bindtap="openHistory">查看历史</button>
      <button class="account-link" size="mini" bindtap="disableHistory">停止保存</button>
    </view>
    <button
      wx:else
      class="account-button"
      size="mini"
      loading="{{accountLoading}}"
      disabled="{{accountLoading}}"
      bindtap="enableHistory"
    >启用历史记录</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{showResults}}" class="results" id="results">
    <view class="results-head">
      <view class="section-title">核验结果</view>
      <view class="progress">{{progressText}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="summary-grid">
      <view class="summary-item" wx:for="{{summary}}" wx:key="label">
        <view class="summary-value">{{item.value}}</view>
        <view class="summary-label">{{item.label}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view
      class="card result-card"
      wx:for="{{results}}"
      wx:key="displayIndex"
      wx:for-item="result"
    >
      <view class="result-head">
        <view class="status status-{{result.status}}">
          <text class="status-mark">{{result.statusMark}}</text>
          <text>{{result.statusLabel}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="confidence">第 {{result.displayIndex}} 条</view>
      </view>

      <view class="submitted">{{result.submitted}}</view>
      <view class="result-note">{{result.note}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{result.displayStyle &amp;&amp; result.displayStyle!=='未识别'}}" class="format-note">引用格式：{{result.displayStyle}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{result.observations.length}}" class="format-note">
        <view>来源差异与补充信息（不直接判错）</view>
        <view wx:for="{{result.observations}}" wx:key="field" wx:for-item="observation">{{observation.field}}：提交 {{observation.submitted}}；来源 {{observation.verified}}。{{observation.reason}}</view>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{result.differences.length}}" class="differences">
        <view class="difference" wx:for="{{result.differences}}" wx:key="field" wx:for-item="difference">
          <view class="difference-field">{{difference.field}}</view>
          <view class="difference-value"><text>提交：</text>{{difference.submitted}}</view>
          <view class="difference-value verified-value"><text>来源记录：</text>{{difference.verified}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{result.canonical &amp;&amp; result.showCanonical}}" class="canonical">
        <button class="copy-citation" size="mini" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="toggleCanonical">{{result.canonicalOpen?"收起":"查看"}} {{result.canonicalLabel||"参考著录"}}（{{result.canonicalStandard||"格式待核对"}}）</button>
        <view wx:if="{{result.canonicalOpen}}">
        <view wx:if="{{result.canonicalNote}}" class="format-note">{{result.canonicalNote}}</view>
        <view>{{result.canonical}}</view>
        <button class="copy-citation" size="mini" data-citation="{{result.canonical}}" bindtap="copyCitation">{{result.canonicalCopyLabel||"复制著录"}}</button>
        <view wx:for="{{result.canonicalWarnings}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="formatCheck" class="format-note">{{formatCheck}}</view>

        </view>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{result.canonicalUnchanged}}" class="format-note">
        <view wx:if="{{result.canonicalComplete}}">原著录可保留。</view>
        <view wx:for="{{result.canonicalWarnings}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="warning">{{warning}}</view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{result.links.length}}" class="result-links">
        <button
          class="source-button"
          size="mini"
          wx:for="{{result.links}}"
          wx:key="url"
          wx:for-item="link"
          data-url="{{link.url}}"
          bindtap="copyUrl"
        >{{link.label}}</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="limits">
    <view class="limits-kicker">BOUNDARIES</view>
    <view class="limits-title">“暂未证实”不等于“虚假”</view>
    <view class="limits-copy">
      证据匹配度依据作品身份字段与证据来源计算，未经统计校准为真实性概率。事实核对与格式检查分开；中文按 GB/T 7714—2025，英文保留可接受的引用格式。若来源暂时不可访问或未被数据库收录，只会标记为“暂未证实”，并提供继续复核的线索。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer">
    <view>重要用途请以出版者或原始网页记录为准</view>
    <navigator class="privacy-link" url="/pages/privacy/privacy">隐私说明</navigator>
    <view class="footer-email">linhu@scu.edu.cn</view>
  </view>
</view>
